<gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 13, 2010 at 7:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7051091806384553899</id><published>2010-05-13T15:29:02.957-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-13T15:29:02.957-06:00</updated><title type='text'>JdL, Jordan Case&amp;#39;s conduct indicates that he c...</title><content type='html'>JdL, Jordan Case&amp;#39;s conduct indicates that he clearly couldn&amp;#39;t handle what he had chosen to ingest. Given that his consumption contributed to his needless death, &lt;br /&gt;I think he would have been better off if he hadn&amp;#39;t partaken in the first place. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Although this isn&amp;#39;t mentioned in my article, Jordan&amp;#39;s friends point out that he was a &amp;quot;veteran&amp;quot; when it came to consuming &amp;#39;shrooms -- and yet he still couldn&amp;#39;t, or didn&amp;#39;t, calibrate his consumption responsibly.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1722104563313033968/comments/default/7051091806384553899'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1722104563313033968/comments/default/7051091806384553899'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/idiocracys-finest-at-work.html?showComment=1273786142957#c7051091806384553899' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/S9pLFt945PI/AAAAAAAAGnM/ZkLMUakTnDM/S220/dad.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/idiocracys-finest-at-work.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1722104563313033968' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1722104563313033968' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 13, 2010 at 3:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5383550478510660764</id><published>2010-05-13T15:21:42.656-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-13T15:21:42.656-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Jordan Case obviously shouldn&amp;#39;t have bee...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Jordan Case obviously shouldn&amp;#39;t have been consuming psychotropic fungi&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Why not?  Drug use should of course be done responsibly, something Mr. Case clearly did not adhere to when he invaded another&amp;#39;s domicile.  However, had he remained in his own home until the effects of the psychotropic fungi had passed, on what basis do you assert that he had crossed a &amp;quot;shouldn&amp;#39;t have&amp;quot; line?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1722104563313033968/comments/default/5383550478510660764'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1722104563313033968/comments/default/5383550478510660764'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/idiocracys-finest-at-work.html?showComment=1273785702656#c5383550478510660764' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/idiocracys-finest-at-work.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1722104563313033968' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1722104563313033968' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemC